          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your resume may be sent to OpenRouter and Google Gemini, or processed by local Ollama if another provider fails. Google’s free tier may use content to improve its products. Use synthetic resumes until privacy and retention have been reviewed." : {
      "localizations" : {
